a(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>平成<rt>へいせい</rt></ruby><ruby>最後<rt>さいご</rt></ruby>のミニライブ＆<ruby>全国<rt>ぜんこく</rt></ruby><ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>でした！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">こんな<ruby>日<rt>ひ</rt></ruby>に<ruby>皆<rt>みな</rt></ruby>さんにお<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>い<ruby>出来<rt>でき</rt></ruby>たなんて、<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>奇跡<rt>きせき</rt></ruby>ですよね</span><span class=\"s4\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-05-04/28912_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5841.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>いたお<ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>です！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>一<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>つ<ruby>一<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>つメッセージ、<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>ませていただきました(</span><span class=\"s1\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ありがとうございます(</span><span class=\"s1\">˙</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\">​˙&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>夜<rt>よる</rt></ruby><ruby>遅<rt>おそ</rt></ruby>い<ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>まで、<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にありがとうございました(</span><span class=\"s1\">TT</span><span class=\"s2\">)(</span><span class=\"s1\">TT</span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">また、お<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いできることを<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみにしています</span><span class=\"s4\">😶💕</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀。</span><span class=\"s1\">. </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> * .</span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> * </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">❀</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">｡</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">✿</span><span class=\"s1\"> *&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-05-04/28912_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5820.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-05-04/28912_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5818.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>小坂<rt>こさか</rt></ruby>、くまになる。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-05-04/28912_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5826.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そして、<ruby>我<rt>わが</rt></ruby>に<ruby>返<rt>かえ</rt></ruby>る。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-05-04/28912_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5824.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">つかまえた。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んでいただきありがとうございます</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>小坂<rt>こさか</rt></ruby><ruby>菜緒<rt>なお</rt></ruby></span><span class=\"s1\">^._.^</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">#112</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ゴールデンウィークはいかがお<ruby>過<rt>す</rt></ruby>ごしでしょうか？</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>小坂<rt>こさか</rt></ruby>は<ruby>京都<rt>きょうと</rt></ruby>に<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>きたかったです</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>度<rt>ど</rt></ruby>、<ruby>清水寺<rt>きよみずでら</rt></ruby>に<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>ったことがあるんですけど</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ちょうど<ruby>春<rt>はる</rt></ruby>で、<ruby>桜<rt>さくら</rt></ruby>が<ruby>満開<rt>まんかい</rt></ruby>だったんですよ</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">もう<ruby>何<rt>なん</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>ねん</rt></ruby>も<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>ってないので、タイミングがあれば<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>きたいなぁなんて</span><span class=\"s4\">😶</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>今<rt>いま</rt></ruby>はどこも<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>が<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>くて、<ruby>人混<rt>ひとご</rt></ruby>みが<ruby>苦手<rt>にがて</rt></ruby>な<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>にとっては<ruby>気合<rt>きあい</rt></ruby>を<ruby>入<rt>い</rt></ruby>れて<ruby>外<rt>そと</rt></ruby>に<ruby>出<rt>で</rt></ruby>なければならないんですけど</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>が<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>いという<ruby>事<rt>こと</rt></ruby>を<ruby>知<rt>し</rt></ruby>っていながら、<ruby>賑<rt>にぎ</rt></ruby>わっている<ruby>街<rt>まち</rt></ruby>に<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>く<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>は<ruby>強者<rt>つわもの</rt></ruby>だと</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>変<rt>へん</rt></ruby>に<ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>るのはやめようと<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じた<ruby>瞬間<rt>しゅんかん</rt></ruby>でもあったし、<ruby>意地<rt>いじ</rt></ruby>でも<ruby>歩<rt>ある</rt></ruby>いてやろうと<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じた<ruby>瞬間<rt>しゅんかん</rt></ruby>でもあって</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>の<ruby>心<rt>こころ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>中<rt>なか</rt></ruby>が<ruby>矛盾<rt>むじゅん</rt></ruby>している<ruby>状態<rt>じょうたい</rt></ruby>になりました（<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby>）</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ゴールデンウィークにどこかお<ruby>出<rt>で</rt></ruby>かけされた<ruby>方々<rt>かたがた</rt></ruby>は<ruby>良<rt>よ</rt></ruby>き<ruby>思い出<rt>おもいで</rt></ruby>が<ruby>作<rt>つく</rt></ruby>れてるといいですね((</span><span class=\"s1\">* </span><span class=\"s5\">॑</span><span class=\"s3\">꒳</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s5\">॑</span><span class=\"s1\">*&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s2\">))</span></span></p></div>\n                    ",
